agm-0969: AGM H6 Mali-G57: hardware layer (iokit/Kernel/arm/AgmMali.cpp: power and clocks after
the vendor qogirl6 platform code, soft reset and G57 quirks, AS 0 with AArch64 4 KB page tables,
an in-order job queue with polled completion, panfrost parameters; boot-arg agm_gpu_test=1 runs
a WRITE_VALUE self test) and the AgmMaliGPU service with panfrost's interface for Mesa
(AgmMaliGPU.cpp, boot-arg agm_gpu=1). GPU memory is cached kernel memory with explicit cache
upkeep: contiguous or write-combined IOBMD allocations come from outside RAM here.

